    {
      "id": "6c6N1_laB___MkVnEC3TY",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15891.450652559151,
      "y": 44489.089909258095,
      "width": 761.4035034179688,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "-2G0ZQZjTqxJ9oLHi2L5g",
      "index": "b0g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2028158765,
      "version": 198,
      "versionNonce": 738918233,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777091503248,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to\neach other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between\nusers",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to each other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between users",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "W15vV0mOwkjSqwTC3NKY2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15891.450652559151,
      "y": 44489.089909258095,
      "width": 761.4035034179688,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "-2G0ZQZjTqxJ9oLHi2L5g",
      "index": "b0h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1919237229,
      "version": 200,
      "versionNonce": 766115511,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777091503248,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to\neach other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between\nusers",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In the follow database, we store how users are connected to each other.\n\nEach user is like a node (point)\nEach follow or friendship is like a connection (line) between users",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "n7hI-DENdbqzdHay5gERH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 15891.45065299258,
      "y": 44775.15388402198,
      "width": 785.1474609375,
      "height": 140,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "-2G0ZQZjTqxJ9oLHi2L5g",
      "index": "b0j",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 657062733,
      "version": 264,
      "versionNonce": 1493412921,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1777091503248,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Using graph relationship will also help to efficiently find\nfollowers and followes list for a user very efficiently. Also, we\nneed to support a large number of users and their relationship\nwith each other.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Using graph relationship will also help to efficiently find followers and followes list for a user very efficiently. Also, we need to support a large number of users and their relationship with each other.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
