      "text": "- Emails in the same conversation/replies are grouped together",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Emails in the same conversation/replies are grouped together",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "fhOMVAVqTLTQN19Su5CCj",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6637.253806834086,
      "y": 37196.58654673664,
      "width": 797.6914672851562,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "W9cjy3qqYNDbelwRDOXb7"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1E",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 935983417,
      "version": 141,
      "versionNonce": 154212535,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777073977682,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- User should be able to create a mailing account\n- Users can compose and send emails to one or more recipients\n- Users can view their inbox, sent, drafts, spam, trash folders,\nand create custom labels/folders\n- User shoule be able to search content across email subject,\nbody, sender.\n- Users should be able to send attachments (images, docs,\nPDFs)\n- Emails in the same conversation/replies are grouped together",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- User should be able to create a mailing account\n- Users can compose and send emails to one or more recipients\n- Users can view their inbox, sent, drafts, spam, trash folders,\nand create custom labels/folders\n- User shoule be able to search content across email subject, body, sender.\n- Users should be able to send attachments (images, docs, PDFs)\n- Emails in the same conversation/replies are grouped together",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "5wix2ufCE05qZpg7MfqwQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 7558.0834078598555,
      "y": 37021.58654696898,
      "width": 727.6792320924135,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "W9cjy3qqYNDbelwRDOXb7"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 437893783,
      "version": 922,
      "versionNonce": 991619543,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777073977682,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n- Scale: 1.8B+ users with billions of emails\n- CAP: Availablity >> Consistency. \n    But system should be highly consistent while creating\nuser account, so that no two user share the same email id\n\nHigh availability: 99.99%+ for compose, inbox, send APIs\nDurability: once accepted, email/attachments should not\nbe lost\n\nSecurity\nFault Taulerance\nRate limiting\nObservibility",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non Functional Requirements\n\n- Scale: 1.8B+ users with billions of emails\n- CAP: Availablity >> Consistency. \n    But system should be highly consistent while creating user account, so that no two user share the same email id\n\nHigh availability: 99.99%+ for compose, inbox, send APIs\nDurability: once accepted, email/attachments should not be lost\n\nSecurity\nFault Taulerance\nRate limiting\nObservibility",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DyjX3BbceT5S5jiRB4mbC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 6772.824618448176,
      "y": 38533.2050868506,
      "width": 482.2156982421875,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1964230295,
      "version": 54,
