      "updated": 1777088681254,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Draft DB\n\nNoSQL\n\nsimple access by user_id/draft_id, \nhigh scale\nunstructure data of emails\n\n{\n  \"draftId\": \"d123\",\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"to\": [\"x@gmail.com\"],\n  \"cc\": [],\n  \"bcc\": [],\n  \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi...\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [\"a1\", \"a2\"],\n  \"updatedAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: userId",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Draft DB\n\nNoSQL\n\nsimple access by user_id/draft_id, \nhigh scale\nunstructure data of emails\n\n{\n  \"draftId\": \"d123\",\n  \"userId\": \"u123\",\n  \"to\": [\"x@gmail.com\"],\n  \"cc\": [],\n  \"bcc\": [],\n  \"subject\": \"Hello\",\n  \"body\": \"Hi...\",\n  \"attachmentIds\": [\"a1\", \"a2\"],\n  \"updatedAt\": 1720748150\n}\n\nPK: userId",
